    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cf318969a788986c1709571",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以获胜者会被授予“橡树女王”称号而闻名的，\r\nＧⅠ比赛『日本橡树大赛』……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9c149f5c35ad8fd1b85d92019ae462ba5ca11a8f00e7e7c72a325aa9955fb4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
