    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a640cb730666a1c31786005",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "等我懂事，查到了母亲的纪录，知道了那场比赛后……\r\n我颤抖了。　然后，就强烈地憧憬着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52883fe2129e991c83198272213d189fd0b96a1bc31b77b50ce03ecc87e987e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
