    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99842961f719ebf69d3ac93f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ba197f3f270489519197083",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "把自己磨练到极致，并光荣地取胜的样子，\r\n令我朝思暮想。我对赛跑的世界，充满了希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d79bfcfcf0c55f03bb432a2469b7e30743866fd351d4f6a1d4b271d2509f3cbf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44d9338c2ab0de100460e29a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd39e74880ed78578e898b06",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最重要的是……我一心向往自己能够像母亲那样，\r\n成为后辈们所憧憬的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d2459093567e27e26deeff39007008020883c4a372e92cea64b7b9bc9a34c83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86747f8cdad8f1971550effb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后辈们明朗的表情，\r\n以及比任何人都温柔地注视着她们的气槽的眼神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7644b6dae5a328229a38399214614ebddc6b0d90f5f73205d0ffc77efb07161f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39f264e79375bfa2753a5828",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:053500a7065e8d4c7f41ba80",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，我选择了做一名“女帝”。\r\n为了能够亲身实现马娘的理想，并指引大家前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93fb3141d03153ffbb501501f8edeee8eb2766320f49a5c022090df551230974",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d798f5be05944c244731a9c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b00327d52426c596433ad7d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就像母亲曾经为我所做的那样……\r\n向大家展示灿烂绽放的未来，以及希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b5ff3c4e623e542d969d95ae2a987bcc6aae8cfe5f572ed285fa74de41c71ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
