    {
      "uid": "zhcn:324ec4dd29c4548150597e26",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……这样的话，仅仅在比赛中取胜是不够的。　整理名为学园的\r\n这片土壤的事，引导后辈的事，全部都是我的使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "039f55583ff5c1eb34a3d04f3f1a2615dc6c587e23197059ffa27672ef719347",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
