    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0166ea00dbebcaf57d9670d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果训练员把这些都当作无谓的东西给扔掉的话，\r\n那我就不需要什么训练员了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "624f4dbfc9e30b3e97a2c3e2660870df8c1b7330318506a5ba212ed1f3901aeb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018004.json",
      "json_path": [
